    {
      "title": "Webflow Content Creator & Developer",
      "ciphertext": "~022072590550707443685",
      "description": "Webflow Content Creator & Developer to own, build, and optimize our digital presence. You will bridge the gap between design, engineering, and marketing. You will be responsible for translating marketing concepts into engaging, high-performing landing pages, managing our Webflow CMS, and driving conversion rates through interactive web experiences. Key Responsibilities Webflow Development: Build, maintain, and scale responsive Webflow websites from Figma wireframes or design concepts. Content Creation & CMS Management: Own the content pipeline by structuring, updating, and managing Webflow CMS collections. Create and publish blog posts, landing pages, and interactive digital experiences aligned with our brand messaging.UI/UX & Interactions: Implement scroll-based effects, micro-interactions, and animations to elevate the user experience. Third-Party Integrations: Connect Webflow with third-party tools and CRM systems (e.g., HubSpot, Google Analytics, Memberstack, Zapier) to enhance site functionality. SEO & Performance Optimization: Regularly audit and improve site speed, accessibility, SEO, and cross-device compatibility.Custom Coding: Write and implement custom HTML, CSS, and JavaScript via the Embed tool to extend Webflow’s native capabilities when required. Asset Creation: Produce or adapt digital assets (graphics, videos, or copy) to ensure they are seamlessly integrated and perform optimally on the web."
    }
